---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="simple-page">
    <h1>Editorial Policy</h1>

    <h2>Our Promise</h2>
    <p>
      Orlisse Living is committed to honest, accurate, and independent editorial content.
      We do not accept payment or gifts in exchange for coverage. Our editorial team
      operates independently from any affiliate or advertising relationships.
    </p>

    <h2>How We Test & Research</h2>
    <p>
      Every product we review goes through a rigorous testing process: hands-on use,
      comparison against competing products, and verification of manufacturer claims.
      For travel and service recommendations, we visit in person whenever possible, and
      supplement with verified user reviews and expert interviews.
    </p>

    <h2>Updates & Corrections</h2>
    <p>
      We regularly review and update our articles to keep them accurate. If you spot
      an error, please contact us — we correct mistakes promptly and note significant
      updates at the top of the article.
    </p>

    <h2>Independence</h2>
    <p>
      Editorial decisions are made solely by our editorial team. Advertisers and
      affiliate partners have no influence over what we cover, how we review, or
      what we recommend.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
